Description: OpenTelemetry Python logging instrumentation
 OpenTelemetry is a collection of tools, APIs, and SDKs used to instrument,
 generate, collect, and export telemetry data (metrics, logs, and traces).
 .
 This package instruments the Python logging module to inject trace
 context (trace id, span id) into log records, correlating application
 logs with distributed traces.
 .
 This package provides the Python 3 library.
